                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more powerless"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "45218356-2f46-47ad-b4f4-a8bbe4711f6b",
                        "entry_id": "43db6c6f-ee3b-3ad8-a9fc-31c29b211147",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most powerless"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a03ef1fd-edaa-3e0c-99c1-509a7d678e5c",
                        "entry_id": "43db6c6f-ee3b-3ad8-a9fc-31c29b211147",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lacking sufficient power or strength."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ef10efd-8736-4b71-9d1e-4994735ed758",
                                "sense_id": "a03ef1fd-edaa-3e0c-99c1-509a7d678e5c",
                                "text": "“Imagine the growing regrets, the longing to escape, the powerless disgust, the surrender, the hate.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "84991369-77a1-4162-bf4a-9beb2457e939",
                                "sense_id": "a03ef1fd-edaa-3e0c-99c1-509a7d678e5c",
                                "text": "In Sweden, as we saw, the mistletoe which is gathered on Midsummer Eve is attached to the ceiling of the house, the horse's stall or the cow's crib, in the belief that this renders the Troll powerless to injure man and beast."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c76026c1-80e8-4fde-bd17-6a537df04afa",
                                "sense_id": "a03ef1fd-edaa-3e0c-99c1-509a7d678e5c",
                                "text": "It is said that his right arm had grown powerless from having been raised so often over the heads of those whom he baptized."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f98962f-1a5b-4b14-a34c-3ef8a90d9f34",
                                "sense_id": "a03ef1fd-edaa-3e0c-99c1-509a7d678e5c",
                                "text": "One thing is clear: after the first accident had occurred, the enginemen on the down express were powerless to avoid the second collision."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2aad3ff3-d3e9-44e9-ad7a-6b450287fb8e",
                                "sense_id": "a03ef1fd-edaa-3e0c-99c1-509a7d678e5c",
                                "text": "Tilling my own grave to keep me level\nJam another dragon down the hole\nDigging to the rhythm and the echo of a solitary siren\nOne that pushes me along and leaves me so\nDesperate and ravenous\nI'm so weak and powerless\nOver you"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "27b98733-26f8-478a-a0a0-12a92ed40d16",
                                "sense_id": "a03ef1fd-edaa-3e0c-99c1-509a7d678e5c",
                                "text": "Frank desperately wanted to help. To do something. Anything. But he was powerless to stop what was about to happen."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f16b57ad-b3dd-35d9-be05-cefcc66ad597",
                        "entry_id": "43db6c6f-ee3b-3ad8-a9fc-31c29b211147",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lacking legal authority."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f099ea93-ff8f-4799-85cf-564b1d36e3d0",
                                "sense_id": "f16b57ad-b3dd-35d9-be05-cefcc66ad597",
                                "text": "The traffic warden was powerless to stop me driving away."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5b833666-ea20-3377-8208-ace5477b0eaf",
                        "entry_id": "43db6c6f-ee3b-3ad8-a9fc-31c29b211147",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Without electricity or electrical power."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e75317e-8b44-4e99-b26b-f45a88891a6a",
                                "sense_id": "5b833666-ea20-3377-8208-ace5477b0eaf",
                                "text": "During the storm, the entire neighborhood was left powerless for several hours"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
